assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Old <a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a> mines. In group with <a href=\"#/wiki/Furious%20Troll\">Furious Trolls</a> almost all the time.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tKeeps 4 squares distance and shoots <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Star\">Throwing Stars</a>, turns invisible very often for about 20 seconds, heals frequently.<br/><br/>A troll legionnaire attacks from a distance. A troll legionnaire will retreat at 8 to 62 (3.81% - 29.52%, deep red to red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThey will most likely be invisible all the time, as they re-cast invisibility and keep distance before the effect wears off (like <a href=\"#/wiki/Warlock\">Warlocks</a>), therefore shoot area runes like <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireball</a> or use spells like <a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a>. Alternatively, change floors for a while until they become visible again.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 3,532 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-156</td>\n<td>59.5</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"93.771234\" style=\"text-align:center;\">94%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Star\"><img alt=\"Throwing Star\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Throwing_Star_f3e62e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Star\">Throwing Star</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-10</td>\n<td>1.6</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"28.595696\" style=\"text-align:center;\">29%\n</td></tr